# Phase 11: licensed programs. GO LICPGM (refused to the pub400
# profile: the refusal is kept), then DSPSFWRSC with every page and its
# F11 views, and its prompt. Every display is left with F3 or F12.
# 185 Page Downs cover the list (2372 rows); pages that repeat the last were dropped.
# No `continue`: a failed step ends the run.
wait "Main Menu"
timeout 30000
type call qcmd
key enter
wait "Command Entry"
type go licpgm
key enter
settle 1500
snap menu-licpgm-refused
key eraseinput
type dspsfwrsc
